{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "b70783a8aa4dfd589b5ec03e52987594eb3df3a493f11e8becb482ee88cb2a49", "ja": "おしゃべりは終わらない", "zh": "闲聊永无止境", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "27c973f71d3b2a9bb58f45fe4ce91961345f485c2045e8ddd8d33559d86070b8", "ja": "打ち上げにカラオケにきたメンバー達。楽し\nくおしゃべりの時間を過ごした後、まだまだ\n劇場に戻っておしゃべりを続けると言う。そ\nの底知れないパワーに驚きつつも、将来性を\n感じるプロデューサーなのだった。", "zh": "来参加庆功宴后又来到卡拉OK的成员们。享\n受了一段愉快的聊天时光后，她们还说要回\n剧场继续聊天。制作人虽然对那深不可测的\n活力感到惊讶，却也感受到了她们的潜力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3e9a51a0ee981da91787457a9b781fa927ecfd90dbdb5209932404fe1d8140d6", "ja": "（4人のPVは絶賛の嵐！　CMのオファーも\n舞い込んで、ますます忙しくなりそうだ）", "zh": "（4人的PV好评如潮！连广告的邀约也找上门来了，看来会越来越忙了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "850025c02c6099a194807df7cef044eafe4eec9620039b79c466194b30ec0fa1", "ja": "（これからのスケジュールをこなすにあたって……\nまずは打ち上げで、景気づけといこう！）", "zh": "（接下来还要完成之后的日程……先在庆功宴上鼓舞一下士气吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "e0373eda1cc988c2daac87d4a2600c6bd395ebbdb9a027c02fe712e1cb54e495", "ja": "わあ……♪　やっぱりカラオケって、\nワクワクしますね！", "zh": "哇……♪果然唱卡拉OK，\n让人心情激动呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "70a9d73c7461a8a45efee0f92dd80db1653278cb293b5d5ce6f78f26481f0aae", "ja": "そういえば……か、カラオケって、\n星梨花ちゃんの希望なんだっけ……？", "zh": "对了……说、说起来，卡拉OK是星梨花的提议来着……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "74c06503ac764d52eeebcd174bb2f8b604c76e33c200aa277077defdae89e7fe", "ja": "はい！　来る機会がほとんどないので、\nちゃんと楽しんでみたかったんです！", "zh": "是的！因为几乎没有机会来，所以一直想好好享受一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "715a0cd9853c6a108aa6b9aa6017664313e31b1a8c51499a3cac56dc1569db7c", "ja": "そうだったんだ……。そ、それなら、\n今日はたくさん、楽しまないとね……♪", "zh": "原来是这样……那、那样的话，今天可得尽情享受才行呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "403ab53269d89f2d5a96085915d4b44804a7e0e3ae63b12671dd181a3994eae2", "ja": "あたしも、こういうカラオケには、あんまし\n慣れてなくてねぇ……なんだか、新鮮だべさ！", "zh": "我也不太习惯这种卡拉OK……感觉还挺新鲜的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "ca1965f71b137fcfed2dbf9ee87be3fc883bc2b28bacde0f1ad09f3a38c147f5", "ja": "ひなたちゃん、地元にいたころは、\nカラオケには行ってたんですか～？", "zh": "日向，你在老家的时候，也会去唱卡拉OK吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "00dc51664174e9aa464b40f1ad9005b893c8859aed810786ef83a70bff583d3e", "ja": "うん、公民館にあるカラオケセットだけどねぇ。\n自治会の人たちと、たまに歌ってたんだよぉ。", "zh": "嗯，虽然只是公民馆里的卡拉OK设备。\n但我偶尔会和自治会的人一起唱歌哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "7d1263221149113fc973aabd9c28a9f2bf58bd508792b78dbaf234d9d9780d64", "ja": "なるほど～。では私も、\n十八番を披露する時かもしれませんな～。ふふふ。", "zh": "原来如此～。那么，也许是时候让我展示一下拿手曲了～。呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0bed7c898a0bb827cc3ccf4e05a51a06b858d4c577af87c49958e6b17f178428", "ja": "（みんな楽しそうでなによりだ。今日くらいは、\n少し羽目を外してでも、楽しんでくれるといいな！）", "zh": "（大家看起来都很开心，这就好。至少今天，希望她们就算稍微放纵一下，也能尽情享受！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "20888b1c9125d98cb1a0a54ccfb7950ca8f1c4eae7adec1ea8a33cb54d2dd77e", "ja": "わたし、恵美さんに教えてもらった\nオリジナルブレンドを飲んでみたいんです！", "zh": "我想尝尝惠美小姐推荐给我的\n独创拼配饮品！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "a3b46343918d6d7f53a51c1e9a3a8037dca3102c71dfcfc95bb3e620ccb6d78b", "ja": "それは、飲み物なのかい？\n電話で注文すればいいのかねぇ。", "zh": "那是饮料吗？打电话订购就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "448baee936542d39cf701c9a0578347e46c28ee789b0ea4cc23d829e6055a877", "ja": "いえ、ドリンクバーというところにジュースが\nたくさんあるので、自分で混ぜて作るんです。", "zh": "不是的，在叫饮料吧的地方有好多果汁，\n所以是要自己混合调配着做出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "e425cdfdb543619f029447c14a0d23e77bdf1524d39789e492395f305235d726", "ja": "確かメロンとぶどうと、あと白いジュースを\n混ぜるはずなんですけど……ええと。", "zh": "好像是要把甜瓜汁和葡萄汁，还有白色的果汁混在一起……嗯，这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "cf8e24a9095727bf714c274de4cea4a65d332fc636ffbed1c27e9eb4793afa80", "ja": "白……ホワイトアスパラ、かねぇ？\n果物があるなら、野菜もあるんじゃないかい？", "zh": "白色……是白芦笋吗？\n既然有水果，那应该也有蔬菜吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "0a68a945913b71504a7f6e42bdc4f7e688eb4b6698d5f1e2c591c2cb9832993d", "ja": "かもしれません……！　ひなたさん、\nついてきてもらってもいいですか……？", "zh": "也许是这样……！　ひなた小姐，可以请你陪我一起去吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "fe3e952bf9579f6e27ce3ebfea876ba0eafec0f1a81ae60c7fe7fb92a73392da", "ja": "もちろんいいよぉ！　ふたりで\nオリジナルブレンドを作るべさ！", "zh": "当然可以啦！咱们俩\n一起做独家特调吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "c923f3100ef3c7d21fbbcd58eb6a099efb5b2ce2ce9c0600d3c7b6add42d213d", "ja": "わあ……！　美也さんの歌、\nと、とっても上手、ですね……！", "zh": "哇啊……！美也唱得，\n真、真的好棒，呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "00598701d2c87457c322759a1ebcbf004390427910ab753a4722ccb740cf1007", "ja": "こ、こういう曲って、あまり聴かないんですけど……\n情緒があるっていうか、懐かしい感じがします……。", "zh": "我、我平时不太听这类歌曲……  \n该说是很有情调吧，总觉得有种怀旧的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "39fde880e8bee270efb8ec79adcc7cc0a3e02374cf91d29cc8d99b9e477f78fa", "ja": "そうだな。懐メロというのかな……\nけど美也、古い歌をよく知っていたな？", "zh": "是啊。应该算是怀旧歌曲吧……\n不过，美也，你居然知道这么老的歌啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "599da0f4bb5f33fdb55477bbf2729d60e488407f8d5d2fb4af404122891f8c24", "ja": "気に入ってもらえてなによりです～。この歌は、\nおじいちゃんに教えてもらった曲なんですよ～。", "zh": "您能喜欢真是太好了～这首歌是爷爷教给我的哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "415be67fa8eac1fa004e1cf8e7ca70924d7d1fe6ba73fe46d6950aa49d2dbd43", "ja": "おじいちゃんには、他にも、演歌を教えてもらったり\nしました～。『万華鏡大漁旗』とか……。", "zh": "爷爷还教过我其他演歌呢～。比如《万花筒大渔旗》……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1023_045kar", "source_sha256": "7e36401d010bfe4dd50176f9dc4ebaf678769db9a77b698d74bc8ec843e31bb3", "ja": "た、タイトルから、潮の香りがしてきそう……。\nちょっと、き、気になるかも……。", "zh": "光、光是从标题就仿佛能闻到海潮的气息……我、我可能有点在意……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1024_042miy", "source_sha256": "43e770f176d1585162af0a64c77f71272030ebe81348ad437171031ae6490d17", "ja": "それでは、みんなで、端から歌っていきましょうね～♪", "zh": "那么，大家就从头开始一起唱吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "4665f0f82437806063dc975ddded11f89f0dbf2ec247368e7ce886e162e954dc", "ja": "あ……もうそろそろ、じ、時間ですね……。\nあっという間でした……。", "zh": "啊……差不多、差不多到时间了呢……\n真是一转眼就过去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "55692cc9f5cc4a0f45b1ed554e1b44f8cd20d3faa58e720fb5c9c2b178b300bf", "ja": "うん。みんなとなら、いくらでも\nおしゃべり出来ちゃうねぇ。", "zh": "嗯。和大家在一起的话，聊多久都聊不够呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "20e1895c2c6710bce931770b906f2c4fe453ed2ddd234a106374431e47c767b5", "ja": "いや……本当によくしゃべっていたな、みんな……。\nよく話題が尽きないなと感心したよ……。", "zh": "不……大家真是聊个没完啊……\n我都佩服你们怎么会有聊不完的话题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "c796302c7b95fbd64389042527a170708e47df52d2fccf56210350ee020a2f30", "ja": "あ！　そういえばわたし、新しい秘密のお話が\nあって……それもお話したかったんです！", "zh": "啊！这么说来，我有个新的小秘密……\n本来也想跟大家说的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1029_042miy", "source_sha256": "dfdaded79d7917b077151d04e3f407d7075fe3662c165cdd10aa0f27ea51423e", "ja": "では、その話は劇場に戻ってから、\n例の部屋でお話するのはどうでしょう～？", "zh": "那么，回剧场之后，我们去那个房间聊聊这件事，怎么样～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1030_035hin", "source_sha256": "8a0b76cfb9d6e38747e80cb2f673b45685709e088c5ffcbfaa2ad19e1e2eab3f", "ja": "それはいい考えだねぇ。\n星梨花ちゃんもゆっくり話せるだろうし。", "zh": "这主意不错呀。\n这样星梨花也能慢慢聊了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1031_042miy", "source_sha256": "f6b5489955ffd88fbbf599975fad62c167ee6d99cef216ce25ed41e67c59727b", "ja": "むふふ。では、さっそく準備をして、\n劇場に向かいましょう～♪", "zh": "嘻嘻。那么，我们马上准备一下，去剧场吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_07_1032_p", "source_sha256": "a07e1c97f240327c6960e7041bbcf71e7fad65502acb17e33ff9383f87305054", "ja": "えっ、あれだけしゃべったのに、\nまだしゃべるのか……？", "zh": "咦，都说了那么多了，还要继续说吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
